B.YW=new A.aQ(B.H,B.ao,31,"Numbers 1 and 0","Reach up with your little fingers to 1 (left) and 0 (right).","10 112 111 711 11 000 101 10 0k 01 111 00 10 00k 010 11j 11l 010 07 d00 0k 711 00 l11 030 000 00 008 11 20 70 00 070 11 01 11 311 0d 01 818 00s 20 01 11",90,0,"Stage 5 \xb7 Number Row","10","Left little: 1 \xb7 Right little: 0","1 is above Q and 0 is above P. These are the farthest keys \u2014 go slowly.")
